OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazil's defeated presidential
OL,8,Fcandidate Flavio Bolsonaro arrives in
OL,9,Fthe US despite police having cancelled
OL,10,Fhis passports
OL,12,FThe senator failed to comply with a
OL,13,FBrazil Supreme Court order to surrender
OL,14,Fthe travel documents
OL,16,FThe US state department tells the BBC
OL,17,Fit will issue visas to Bolsonaro and
OL,18,Fhis family
